    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The process of refining dream token Immortal Gu happens within Wu Shuai’s dream. As immortal materials are refined one by one, the final revelation is that Tai Qin must willingly sacrifice her own life to complete the last step. After he learns of dragonman extermination, the dream tells him that to deal with that move he has to refine dream token Immortal Gu first. Tai Qin agrees. Dream Token is refined, and rank eight Dragon Palace is constructed next. At a gathering of dragonman Gu Immortals, seventh young master accuses Wu Shuai of using his most beloved wife as the Gu material.",
        "chapters": [
          1845
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
